-    $$ \alpha_{mb} = \alpha_{static} \cdot \frac{A_1}{A_2} = \alpha_{static} \cdot \frac{A_1}{A_1 + 2ls} $$
-    where $\alpha_{static}$ is the opacity used for the non-blurred splat [S1, unofficial].
